  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organisation (FAO) - Early Action and Resilience Transformation in Humanitarian (EARTH)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will invest in the FAO&#x2019;s Emergency and Resilience activities across the humanitarian- development nexus to protect vulnerable communities from food insecurity now, and in future. It will focus on supporting the FAO&#x2019;s early response humanitarian work.</narrative>
  </description>
